<title>LITHUANIA: Lithuanian Oct unemployment unchanged at 6.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Lithuanian Oct unemployment unchanged at 6.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lithuania's unemployment rate was unchanged at 6.4 percent in October compared with the previous month although the number of registered unemployed declined, the labour exchange said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>			     Oct '96	  Sept '96	  Oct '95</p>
<p>Unemployment rate	6.4 pct	  6.4 pct	   6.7 pct</p>
<p>Number of unemployed   111,614	  112,491	   116,762</p>
<p>--Riga newsroom +371 7 21 52 40</p>
</text>
